    "detailed_description": "Introducing a one-of-a-kind VR experience, POI: VR Dance game! Step into the captivating world of Poi dancing, where you can do the intricate movements of this beautiful art form, all from the comfort of your own home. With immersive and intuitive controls, you will feel as though you are truly in the midst of a live Poi dance performance of your own. Practice and perfect your moves in a stunning virtual environment with breathtaking visuals and music that will transport you to another realm. Whether you're a seasoned dancer or a beginner, POI: VR Dance is the perfect way to explore and appreciate the art of Poi dancing in a whole new way. So what are you waiting for? Grab your VR headset and get ready to dance!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease be aware that the demo is not fully optimized for all hardware at this stage so there may be some performance issues upon enabling certain heavy effects.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour feedback &amp; support means the world to us :)",
    "about_the_game": "Introducing a one-of-a-kind VR experience, POI: VR Dance game! Step into the captivating world of Poi dancing, where you can do the intricate movements of this beautiful art form, all from the comfort of your own home. With immersive and intuitive controls, you will feel as though you are truly in the midst of a live Poi dance performance of your own. Practice and perfect your moves in a stunning virtual environment with breathtaking visuals and music that will transport you to another realm. Whether you're a seasoned dancer or a beginner, POI: VR Dance is the perfect way to explore and appreciate the art of Poi dancing in a whole new way. So what are you waiting for? Grab your VR headset and get ready to dance!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease be aware that the demo is not fully optimized for all hardware at this stage so there may be some performance issues upon enabling certain heavy effects.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour feedback &amp; support means the world to us :)",
    "short_description": "Experience the beauty of POI: VR Dance. Immerse yourself in a stunning virtual world and perfect your skills with intuitive controls. Whether you're a seasoned dancer or a beginner, POI: VR Dance is the perfect way to explore this beautiful art form from the comfort of your home.",
